1) freshBuild listens for vite:preloadError and cancels it
   ok   listener registered from watchForNewBuild, event cancelled
2) the reload happens once per tab, through a sessionStorage flag
   ok   stands down under the prerenderer, offline and over a refused save, then flag read, set, then reload, in that order
3) RouteErrorBoundary reloads once on a chunk load error through the same guard
   ok   chunk errors reload once through the shared guard, after the held saves of the game that just went are let go
4) main.tsx still boots the watcher
   ok   watchForNewBuild() called at boot
5) every reload freshBuild makes asks for waiting saves first
   ok   check, reloadOnceForStaleChunk, reloadToRetryChunk: each asks for waiting saves before it reloads
6) the reloads on every page (the update toast, the footer) ask for waiting saves first
   ok   the update toast reloads through the shared guard, and the footer retries a waiting save before its reload
7) a page that asked for its reload waits with it (the page flag)
   ok   declared false, set once after the once flag and after the reload call, read by the listener after the kit line

